{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55647","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十五 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"擕筇闲步望山行，竟日逍遥任野情。\n上岭梯登危石侧，渡溪桥踏古槎横。\n绿罗水皱岩根急，红锦霞舒海面明。\n一轴咏怀高尚意，援毫因事偶吟成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}